msgid "Byte transport, TLS and MQTT composition"
msgstr "字节传输、TLS 与 MQTT 装配"

msgid "`byte_stream.h` defines immediate partial reads and copied writes with finite absolute deadlines. SUCCESS reports local byte acceptance, not peer delivery; BUSY with zero bytes requires explicit owner progress. No caller buffer remains borrowed after a stream operation returns. The optional `Nexus::LwIPTCP` client implements this face over the pinned NO_SYS IPv4 stack. Products still own the executor, peer selection, trusted time, entropy and shutdown/reconnect policy."
msgstr "`byte_stream.h` 定义了带有限绝对截止时间的即时部分读取和复制写入。SUCCESS 表示本地字节准入，不表示已交付对端；BUSY 且字节数为零时，需要所有者显式推进。字节流操作返回后，不再借用调用者的缓冲区。可选的 `Nexus::LwIPTCP` 客户端在锁定的 NO_SYS IPv4 协议栈之上实现此接口。执行器、对端选择、可信时间、熵源以及停机和重连策略仍由产品负责。"

