msgid "Exact pinned PCB/pbuf client layout, composition only"
msgstr "锁定版本的精确 PCB／pbuf 客户端布局，仅供装配使用"

msgid "The composition initializes lwIP once and supplies a live network adapter, caller-owned storage and a positive receive-frame budget. All raw stack APIs, callbacks, network service and clients share one serialized NO_SYS executor. Call facade data/control outside raw callbacks; nested cross-facade mutation is rejected with BUSY. No socket layer, worker, scheduler, lock, name registry or maximum opaque pool is created. A successful TCP start admits CONNECTING; it does not establish the connection. Its first finite connect deadline cannot be extended. The existing byte face is a stateful handle, not a readiness proof."
msgstr "装配代码仅初始化一次 lwIP，并提供有效的网络适配器、调用者拥有的存储以及正数接收帧预算。全部原始协议栈 API、回调、网络推进和客户端由同一串行 NO_SYS 执行器负责。接口的数据和控制调用必须位于原始回调之外；跨接口的嵌套修改以 BUSY 拒绝。组件不创建 socket 层、worker、调度器、锁、名称注册表或最大尺寸不透明对象池。TCP start 成功只表示准入 CONNECTING，不表示连接已经建立。首次有限连接截止时间不能延长。既有字节接口是带状态的句柄，不是就绪证明。"

msgid "TCP writes use official copied admission: a positive partial count releases the caller input immediately, while queued data remains bounded stack storage. Later output failure cannot undo that acceptance. Diagnostics continue to report that failure, and subsequent data/service calls fail until explicit abort. RX holds at most one accepted pbuf chain; refused chains stay lwIP-owned. Only consumed bytes receive credit. Buffered bytes precede orderly FIN, and peer half-close still permits writes. A frame budget bounds acquisition, not the total wall time of arbitrary raw callbacks. Each nonzero byte attempt may perform one explicitly budgeted network pass."
msgstr "TCP 写入使用官方复制准入：正数部分写入计数表示调用者可立即复用输入，已排队数据仍保存在协议栈的有界存储中。之后的输出失败不能撤销该准入。诊断持续报告该失败，后续数据／推进调用在显式 abort 之前仍保持失败。RX 最多持有一条已接受的 pbuf 链；被拒收的链仍归 lwIP 所有。只对实际消费的字节返还接收额度。缓冲数据先于有序 FIN 交付，对端半关闭后仍允许写入。帧预算限制取得的帧数，不限制任意原始回调的总耗时。每次非零字节尝试最多可以执行一轮显式预算的网络推进。"

msgid "Official PCB allocation shares the bounded stack pool and its reclamation policy. It may progress pending closes or reclaim TIME_WAIT, LAST_ACK, CLOSING and lower-priority active connections, invoking other clients' error callbacks even if the new start later fails. Local rejection retains no new references for that client; it does not promise a globally unchanged stack."
msgstr "官方 PCB 分配共享有界协议栈池及其回收策略。它可能推进待关闭连接，或回收 TIME_WAIT、LAST_ACK、CLOSING 及较低优先级的活动连接；即使新的 start 随后失败，也可能调用其他客户端的错误回调。本地拒绝表示该客户端不保留新的引用，不承诺整个协议栈未发生变化。"

msgid "After producers join, the owner consumes buffered RX and explicitly progresses and retries close on BUSY under the first finite close deadline. That deadline cannot be extended. Timeout requires explicit abort while storage stays live; abort discards local data and detaches callbacks. Successful close proves this client context's final stack access. The official stack may still own deferred FIN and TIME_WAIT state. Preserve the network adapter, global pools, timers and unchanged clock domain until the product's complete stack shutdown/restart procedure permits withdrawal. Client detachment does not prove global stack shutdown or MAC/PHY drain."
msgstr "生产者完成 join 后，所有者消费缓冲 RX，并在首次有限关闭截止时间内遇到 BUSY 时显式推进和重试 close。该截止时间不能延长。超时后必须显式 abort，存储在此期间仍须有效；abort 丢弃本地数据并撤除回调引用。close 成功仅证明此客户端上下文已完成最后一次协议栈访问。官方协议栈仍可能保留待后续处理的 FIN 及 TIME_WAIT 状态。在产品的完整协议栈停机／重启流程允许撤回之前，网络适配器、全局存储池、定时器和未改变的时钟域都必须保持有效。客户端上下文脱离回调引用不证明全局协议栈停机或 MAC／PHY 已排空。"

msgid "Ordinary TLS/MQTT consumers include `tls.h` or `client.h` and link `Nexus::TLS` or `Nexus::CoreMQTT`. Their public session types are opaque and expose no supplier headers or profile macros. Only the static composition translation unit selects `Nexus::TLSStorage` with `nexus/tls/storage.h`, or `Nexus::CoreMQTTStorage` with `nexus/mqtt/core_mqtt_storage.h`, to allocate the exact pinned backend layout. Keep explicit storage targets local to composition; fields are implementation state, not business control APIs or binary ABI promises. Products explicitly call `nexus_add_tls()` or `nexus_add_coremqtt()` to create the selected targets."
msgstr "普通 TLS／MQTT 调用者包含 `tls.h` 或 `client.h`，并链接 `Nexus::TLS` 或 `Nexus::CoreMQTT`。公共会话类型是不透明类型，不暴露厂商头文件或配置宏。只有静态装配翻译单元选择 `Nexus::TLSStorage` 与 `nexus/tls/storage.h`，或 `Nexus::CoreMQTTStorage` 与 `nexus/mqtt/core_mqtt_storage.h`，以分配锁定后端的精确布局。显式存储目标必须局限于装配代码；字段是实现状态，不是业务控制 API 或二进制 ABI 承诺。产品显式调用 `nexus_add_tls()` 或 `nexus_add_coremqtt()` 创建选定目标。"

msgid "The TLS profile is one serialized TLS 1.2 client/PSA domain using ECDHE-ECDSA P-256 and AES-128-GCM/SHA-256. It requires explicit DER trust, trusted UTC and a reviewed entropy-quality assertion. Its 64 KiB caller arena and 512 B TX stage exclude session metadata, transport memory and stack. Join facade users, abort the session, then stop the runtime; failed or BUSY cleanup retains its resources. The MQTT 3.1.1 profile provides clean sessions and QoS0/1; callbacks borrow incoming views only until return. Explicit DISCONNECT and TLS close report local progress and do not replace lower-layer drain or peer acknowledgement. The component contracts detail [network](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/network/README.md), [TLS](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/tls/README.md) and [MQTT](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/mqtt/README.md) ownership and fixed profile limits."
msgstr "TLS 配置是单一串行 TLS 1.2 客户端／PSA 域，使用 ECDHE-ECDSA P-256 和 AES-128-GCM/SHA-256。它要求显式 DER 信任材料、可信 UTC 和经过审查的熵质量声明。调用者提供的 64 KiB 内存区和 512 B TX 暂存区不包含会话元数据、传输存储和栈。先 join 全部接口使用者，再 abort 会话，然后停止 runtime；失败或 BUSY 的清理仍保留资源。MQTT 3.1.1 配置提供 clean session 和 QoS0/1；回调仅在返回前借用传入视图。显式 DISCONNECT 和 TLS close 表示本地推进，不替代下层排空或对端确认。[网络](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/network/README.md)、[TLS](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/tls/README.md) 和 [MQTT](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/mqtt/README.md) 组件合同详细规定所有权及固定配置限制。"

msgid "For both Ethernet adapter profiles, successful link output reports frame admission. A failed SETTLED TX outcome remains observable once through `nx_lwip_adapter_service`; until that observation, another link output cannot overwrite or reuse the TX buffer. Observing the error clears only the settled, unborrowed request. It adds no error queue or instance storage and does not reset the MAC, replay a packet or choose a product recovery policy. An ACTIVE or QUARANTINED borrow remains retained. The TCP byte facade keeps its existing connection-failure policy; frame-error observation does not promise recovery."
msgstr "对于两种 Ethernet adapter 配置，link output 成功表示帧已被接纳。失败的 SETTLED TX 结果会保留，并通过 `nx_lwip_adapter_service` 报告一次；在该次观察之前，另一次 link output 不得覆盖或复用 TX 缓冲区。观察错误只会清除已经结清且不再被借用的请求。此机制不新增错误队列或实例存储，也不复位 MAC、重放数据包或选择产品恢复策略。ACTIVE 或 QUARANTINED 的借用仍被保留。TCP 字节 facade 保留其既有的连接失败策略；观察到帧错误不承诺恢复。"

msgid "Selected lwIP RX payload loans"
msgstr "选定的 lwIP RX 负载借用"

msgid "Select one singleton NO_SYS stack profile per image. The default `Nexus::LwIP` and `Nexus::LwIPTCP` profiles retain copied RX and their existing storage layouts. The explicit targets below select RX payload loans; CMake rejects an image combining copied and loaned profiles, including a copied TCP target combined with loaned adapter storage. These targets create no second stack, netif, executor, worker or allocator."
msgstr "每个镜像选择一个单例 NO_SYS 协议栈配置。默认 `Nexus::LwIP` 和 `Nexus::LwIPTCP` 配置保留复制式 RX 及其既有存储布局。下列显式目标选择 RX 负载借用；CMake 拒绝在同一镜像中组合复制式与借用式配置，也拒绝将复制式 TCP 目标与借用式 adapter 存储组合。这些目标不创建第二个协议栈、netif、执行器、worker 或分配器。"

