msgid "These probes do not provide a real MAC descriptor ring or payload buffers. The selected adapter costs 628 B more Flash and 11072 B less total SRAM in this exact fixture. Reducing the selected pool from 24 to two blocks saves 11616 B with unchanged adapter behavior and layout. These are image/link measurements; installed-SDK qualification and actual DMA/cache, PHY, throughput, latency and physical HIL evidence remain separate."
msgstr "这些探针没有提供真实的 MAC 描述符环或载荷缓冲区。在此精确配置中，选定 adapter 多占用 628 B Flash，总 SRAM 减少 11072 B。保持 adapter 行为和布局不变，将选定池从 24 块减少到两块可节省 11616 B。这些数据来自镜像／链接测量；已安装 SDK 资格及实际 DMA／cache、PHY、吞吐量、延迟和物理 HIL 证据仍须独立取得。"

msgid "Reference software-host interoperability chain"
